      "canonical_latex": "\\eta_p := \\frac{F V_0}{\\Delta \\dot{E}_k} \\approx \\frac{2 V_0}{V_e + V_0},\\quad \\eta_{\\mathrm{th}} := \\frac{\\Delta \\dot{E}_k}{\\dot{m}_f Q_{\\mathrm{LHV}}},\\quad \\eta_o := \\eta_{\\mathrm{th}}\\eta_p = \\frac{F V_0}{\\dot{m}_f Q_{\\mathrm{LHV}}}",
