      "canonical_latex": "\\eta_d := \\frac{h_{02s} - h_0}{h_{02} - h_0},\\quad \\eta_c := \\frac{h_{03s} - h_{02}}{h_{03} - h_{02}},\\quad \\pi_b := \\frac{p_{04}}{p_{03}},\\quad \\eta_t := \\frac{h_{04} - h_{05}}{h_{04} - h_{05s}},\\quad \\eta_n := \\frac{V_e^2 / 2}{h_{05} - h_{es}}",
